  "adaptations": [
    "Protocol 8 adds 86-byte private CameraState tag with IDs/settings/force, not poses or GPU structures.",
    "Publish only the first active original scripted descriptor; retain original remote-view priority on the client.",
    "Derive server movement/look gates from checked original camera ownership, not peer nominations.",
    "Append camera changes after original private events; force identity preserves death/respawn ordering.",
